  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "The unusual, unmaple-like leaves are three-lobed and the long narrow central lobe has a sharply pointed tip and irregularly notched margins which tend to turn up to form a trough. The short stubby side lobes are near the base and radiate outwards from the leafstalk. The shiny rich green leaves turn brilliant scarlet and orange in the fall. This hardy cultivar forms a dense, rounded small shrub."
